## 🔐 Secrets Management

### Never Commit Secrets
```bash
# ✅ Good: .gitignore includes
.env
.env.local
.env.development
.env.test
*.pem
*.key

# ❌ Bad: Hardcoded secrets
const API_KEY = 'sk_live_12345...';  // NEVER
const DB_PASSWORD = 'mypassword123';  // NEVER
```

### Use Environment Variables
```typescript
// ✅ Good
const config = {
  database: {
    host: process.env.POSTGRES_HOST,
    password: process.env.POSTGRES_PASSWORD,
  },
  kafka: {
    broker: process.env.KAFKA_BROKER,
  },
};

// ❌ Bad
const config = {
  database: {
    host: 'localhost',
    password: 'admin123',  // NEVER hardcode
  },
};
```

### Environment Variable Validation
```typescript
// ✅ Good: Validate on startup
@Injectable()
export class ConfigService {
  constructor() {
    this.validateEnv();
  }

  private validateEnv(): void {
    const required = [
      'POSTGRES_HOST',
      'POSTGRES_PASSWORD',
      'AWS_ACCESS_KEY_ID',
    ];

    for (const key of required) {
      if (!process.env[key]) {
        throw new Error(`Missing required environment variable: ${key}`);
      }
    }
  }
}
```

