## 📝 Logging Safely

### Don't Log PII
```typescript
// ❌ Bad: Logging sensitive data
this.logger.log('User data:', {
  email: user.email,          // PII
  phone: user.phone,          // PII
  password: user.password,    // CRITICAL - NEVER LOG
  ssn: user.ssn,              // PII
});

// ✅ Good: Log non-sensitive identifiers
this.logger.log('User action', {
  userId: user.id,            // UUID - safe
  action: 'login',
  timestamp: new Date(),
});
```

### Sanitize Error Messages
```typescript
// ❌ Bad: Exposing internal details
throw new Error(`Database query failed: ${sqlQuery}`);
throw new Error(`Connection to ${dbHost}:${dbPort} failed`);

// ✅ Good: Generic error messages
throw new InternalServerErrorException('Database operation failed');
throw new ServiceUnavailableException('External service unavailable');
```

### Structured Logging
```typescript
// ✅ Good: Structured, searchable logs
this.logger.log('Job created', {
  jobId,
  type: job.type,
  submittedBy: job.submittedBy,
  timestamp: job.submittedAt,
});

this.logger.error('Job failed', {
  jobId,
  error: error.message,
  stack: error.stack,
});
```

