## 🔐 Data Protection

### Encrypt Sensitive Data
```typescript
// Current: No encryption for stored data
// Production TODO: Encrypt sensitive fields

// ✅ Future: Field-level encryption
@Column({ type: 'text', transformer: {
  to: (value: string) => encrypt(value, process.env.ENCRYPTION_KEY),
  from: (value: string) => decrypt(value, process.env.ENCRYPTION_KEY),
}})
sensitiveData: string;
```

### HTTPS Only
```bash
# ✅ Production: Always use HTTPS
ORCHESTRATOR_URL=https://dtm.example.com

# ❌ Production: Never use HTTP
# ORCHESTRATOR_URL=http://dtm.example.com
```

### Database Connection Security
```typescript
// ✅ Good: TLS for database connections
{
  type: 'postgres',
  host: process.env.POSTGRES_HOST,
  ssl: process.env.NODE_ENV === 'production' ? {
    rejectUnauthorized: true,
    ca: fs.readFileSync('/path/to/ca.pem').toString(),
  } : false,
}
```

