## 🚨 Security Features Implemented

### 1. Simulated Delays Protection
```typescript
// ✅ Protected by environment variable
if (
  input.simulatedDelay &&
  process.env.ENABLE_REQUESTS_FOR_SIMULATED_DELAYS === 'true'
) {
  await this.simulateDelay(input.simulatedDelay);
}
// If env var not set or false, simulated delays ignored
```

### 2. Query Parameterization
```typescript
// ✅ All database queries use parameters
const job = await this.repo.createQueryBuilder('job')
  .where('job.id = :id', { id })  // Parameterized
  .getOne();
```

### 3. Input Validation
```typescript
// ✅ All API endpoints validate inputs
@Post()
async create(@Body() dto: ValidatedDto) {
  // class-validator ensures dto is valid
}
```

### 4. Error Handling
```typescript
// ✅ All Lambda workers use try-catch
try {
  await processMessage(message);
  return { batchItemFailures: [] };
} catch (error) {
  await callbackOrchestrator({ status: 'failed', error: error.message });
  return { batchItemFailures: [{ itemIdentifier: message.messageId }] };
}
```

