## 🔍 Security Monitoring

### What to Monitor
```typescript
// ✅ Log security events
this.logger.warn('Multiple failed login attempts', {
  userId,
  ip: request.ip,
  attempts: failedAttempts,
});

this.logger.error('Unauthorized access attempt', {
  endpoint: request.url,
  ip: request.ip,
  timestamp: new Date(),
});

this.logger.info('API key usage', {
  apiKeyId,
  endpoint: request.url,
  responseTime: duration,
});
```

### Alerts to Configure
- Multiple failed authentication attempts
- Unusual API usage patterns
- Slow query performance (potential DoS)
- High error rates
- Unexpected data access patterns
- Database connection failures

